    "title": "Express origin, destination and distance",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-spatial-prepositions-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Express origin, destination and distance",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "从 introduces the starting point before the action. Keep the starting point distinct from a destination or the direction of travel. 离 + reference place + 远/近 describes distance; 从…到… marks a route, not how far apart the places are.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我从家到学校。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ cóng jiā dào xuéxiào 。",
                "meaning": "I go from home to school.",
                "audio": "6e8e915f7e51677d4d35ff1ba23d98602dd42c348adc6ce4f12db94cf7428974"
              },
              {
                "text": "学校离我家很近。",
                "pinyin": "xuéxiào lí wǒ jiā hěn jìn 。",
                "meaning": "The school is close to my home.",
                "audio": "eb57083e43d51700daf2074c70860229d2c28aca33cec4d7d7a034ba13ae2209"
              },
              {
                "text": "学校离我家很远。",
                "pinyin": "xuéxiào lí wǒ jiā hěn yuǎn 。",
                "meaning": "The school is far from my home.",
                "audio": "0014216aec5861efd3d04c39c209fa6ed9e44888877cd0b2ee0d4c73561cbece"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
